*************************************************************************
* Supervisory file for KOREA 2022
* Created on 25.08.2025
* Based on code by Liliana Calderon
************************************************************************
** NB: 
* Probabilities of death come from KINFERT
* Fertility rates come from KINFERT
************************************************************************
segments  1
input_file presim

random_father 1
marriage_after_childbirth 0 
marriage_eval distribution
marriage_queues 1
hetfert 1
bint 12

************************************************************************
* Run for 200 years in order to have full kinship networks
duration 2400
include rates/fert
include rates/marriage
include rates/mort
run
